petgraph (MIT OR Apache-2.0)
================================================================
cdcl/graph.go stores its conflict graph the way petgraph's Graph does
(linked edge lists with two next pointers per edge, swap-remove on node
removal) and walks it in DfsPostOrder order, so that conflict explanations
match resolvo's, which uses petgraph. No petgraph code was copied.
https://github.com/petgraph/petgraph
